     "title": "I have multiple, structurally identical schemas in postgres. Is there a way to &quot;code-share&quot; views and queries",
     "body": "<p>In my multi-tenant postgres database, I have a schema per tenant for my data warehouse with the same tables in each.\nI wish to create views and queries for these tables. If I were programming I would practice DRY and structure my code so that all of these were parameterised by the tenant. How do I achieve a similar structure in postgres?</p>\n"
    }
